  "prompts": {
    "walk": "Exact attached Cannonbolt: broad round WHITE body, BLACK shoulder/back and flank sections, large smooth YELLOW oval armored plates on shoulders, back and knees, small black face with TWO green eyes, forehead black-white Omnitrix, two short legs, two heavy arms with black clawed fingers. Eight sequential UNCURLED heavy walking cycle phases: left heel contact, weight-taking, left push/right passing, right forward swing, right heel contact, weight-taking, right push/left passing, left forward swing. Alternating large arms and short legs, subtle broad-torso sway, consistent yellow plates. Keep uncurled walking body and face throughout; NO ball transformation in this walk sheet. Eight full-body right-facing poses in4x2 transparent sheet; crisp cartoon cel style, no effects.",
    "shell": "EXACT attached Cannonbolt: broad white body/black sections, smooth YELLOW armored shoulder/back/knee plates, green eyes in small black face, forehead badge, short legs and arms with black claws. 1 Shell slam anticipation full uncurled low crouch, feet planted and arms drawn close. 2 starting curl: head tucks downward, arms fold inward over chest and knees draw inward, yellow plates rotate together. 3 FULLY CURLED ROUND YELLOW AND BLACK armored sphere, no exposed face, hands or feet, circular yellow armor separated by black seams, exactly same armor colors. 4 same fully curled circular armored sphere in a second rotational orientation. 5 same sphere compressed slightly at lower edge for a powerful downward ground IMPACT, no floor/effects. 6 beginning uncurl with head emerging and both hands/feet opening from ball. 7 recovered low crouch complete body. 8 neutral uncurled reference stance. Keep same body volume: sphere diameter about seventy-five percent of standing height. Body-only, no dust or trails. Eight full-body right-facing poses in4x2 transparent sheet; crisp cartoon cel style, no effects."
  },
